<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Uniserv raises yr shr, declares div.</title>
<headline>Uniserv raises yr shr, declares div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Jan 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, diluted (cts)    41.8	  vs  22.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 8.0	   vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   17.07	 vs  12.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, exceps	 20.6	  vs  7.39</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.36	  vs  3.67</p>
<p>Div payable June 13</p>
<p>on register May 30</p>
<p>Full name: United Service Technologies Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it expected a continued improvement in performance. It said operating performance should be enhanced by a number of strategic acquistions that should assist the group in achieving a stronger international market position.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
